## ◈ 01 — PROJECT OVERVIEW

**OpsPilot AI** is an AI-powered IT incident management and operations intelligence platform designed to help engineering and DevOps teams investigate application issues, analyze operational logs, identify potential root causes, and generate actionable troubleshooting recommendations.

The platform combines artificial intelligence, incident analysis, and operational intelligence to simplify troubleshooting and improve incident response workflows.

Built using Python, FastAPI, React, and PostgreSQL, OpsPilot AI aims to provide engineering teams with a centralized environment for incident investigation and operational decision support.

